{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>Twenty-two thousand.</b> Corresponding to them, the Holy One, blessed be He, came with angels at the time of the giving of the Torah, as it is said: ״רכב אלהים רבותים אלפי שנאן״ — and they expound that they are none other than שנאן angels, and רבותים, and אלפי — totalling twenty-two thousand. And since it was revealed and known before the Holy One, blessed be He, that all Israel would serve the calf except the tribe of Levi, therefore He brought angels only corresponding to the tribe of Levi."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:55.000297822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}